# A copying constructor is handed its own instances through a list that Link has lost: none is seen to arrive, and not every caller of a constructor that instances name is known. In a loop the guess
# stands all the same: it holds here at every turn, and where it fails the constructor is walked in line once more. Outside loops, where a failing guess leaves the copy for the slow version, it is dropped.
# RUN: walk f2 mechanisms=all
# REQUIRES: entries-of-bun
# CHECK: GetSlot {{*}} key="wide" receivers=[L0] level=Expected
# CHECK: GetSlot {{*}} key="tall" receivers=[L0] level=Expected
